### Ask Claude a question (IntelliJ: click the green ▶ next to the request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the difference between a JDK and a JRE?"
}

### Validation error: blank question → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": ""
}

### The same call straight to Anthropic with curl (run in a terminal):
# curl https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer $ANTHROPIC_API_KEY" \
#   -H "anthropic-version: 2026-10-21" \
#   -H "content-type: application/json" \
#   -d '{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","max_tokens":1024,"system":"Answer in one sentence.","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What is a JVM?"}]}'
